>>SOURCE FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RETAIL.
*> Phase 1 retail/batch sample — OCCURS, PERFORM UNTIL, EVALUATE, PIC V99.
*> No CICS. Toward Blu Age–class rehost subset; not full Blu Age.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IDX           PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
01 WS-LIMIT         PIC 9(2) VALUE 3.
01 WS-STATUS        PIC X(4) VALUE "OPEN".
01 WS-TAX-RATE      PIC V99 VALUE .08.
01 WS-LINE-TOTAL    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-GRAND-TOTAL   PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-PRICE-TABLE.
   05 WS-PRICE      PIC 9(5)V99 OCCURS 3 TIMES.
01 WS-QTY-TABLE.
   05 WS-QTY        PIC 9(3) OCCURS 3 TIMES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SECTION SECTION.
    MOVE 10.50 TO WS-PRICE(1).
    MOVE 2.25 TO WS-PRICE(2).
    MOVE 7.00 TO WS-PRICE(3).
    MOVE 2 TO WS-QTY(1).
    MOVE 4 TO WS-QTY(2).
    MOVE 1 TO WS-QTY(3).
    MOVE 1 TO WS-IDX.
    PERFORM ACCUM-LINE UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE WS-STATUS
        WHEN "OPEN"
            DISPLAY "RETAIL TOTAL " WS-GRAND-TOTAL
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "RETAIL ERR"
    END-EVALUATE
    STOP RUN.
ACCUM-LINE.
    COMPUTE WS-LINE-TOTAL = WS-PRICE(WS-IDX) * WS-QTY(WS-IDX).
    COMPUTE WS-GRAND-TOTAL = WS-GRAND-TOTAL + WS-LINE-TOTAL + (WS-LINE-TOTAL * WS-TAX-RATE).
    ADD 1 TO WS-IDX.
